1 NOTE Married [[misabella_t]] at Kraainem on **10 April 1900** (act nr. 3, S28). Born at
2 CONT **Sint-Stevens-Woluwe on 5 December 1879**, a *polijster*, son of [[jbbossin]] — dead since
2 CONT 1887 — and [[maria_wolf]], who kept an inn there.
2 CONT
2 CONT **He shares his wife's mother's surname, and that is left as a question, not an answer.** His
2 CONT bride's mother is [[bossin]], Antonia Bossin of Sint-Stevens-Woluwe, and the witnesses at this
2 CONT wedding include two more Bossins, hoveniers of Zaventem and Kraainem. Sint-Stevens-Woluwe is a
2 CONT small commune and the families are very likely connected — but nothing in the act says how,
2 CONT and a shared surname in one village is not a link. No parent line is drawn.
2 CONT
2 CONT **Note the id.** He is not [[ludovica_bossin]], Antonia's sister born 1853; the two ids differ
2 CONT by a single letter and the people differ by a generation and a sex. This one carries his birth
2 CONT year for exactly that reason.
2 CONT
2 CONT FRONTIER: his parents' marriage, which would say whether [[jbbossin]] descends from the same
2 CONT Bossins as Antonia.
