1 NOTE Daughter of [[edouard_bocklandt]] and [[marie_vanbergen]], and [[louise_bocklandt]]'s
2 CONT sister. Her marriage act — Oostende nr. 11, 21 January 1893
2 CONT ([[agatha-oostende-1893-marriage-bocklandt-dubuy]]) — names her born at Hamme 12 May 1872,
2 CONT *werkmeid*, resident at Oostende, daughter of Eduardus Bocklandt (54, *touwslagersknecht*)
2 CONT and the already-deceased Maria Louisa Vanbergen. She married **Justinus Vincentius Dubuy**
2 CONT (b. Oostende 29 Dec 1870, *touwslagersknecht* — her own father's trade), son of the
2 CONT already-deceased Justinus Vincentius Lud. Dubuy and of Carolina Reck. AGATHA serves this
2 CONT act only as an "analyse van akte" (index transcription), not the register image, hence
