2 DATE 18 DEC 1874
2 PLAC Sint-Stevens-Woluwe
1 FAMC @F1@
1 NOTE Named as the child in a civil birth act at **Sint-Stevens-Woluwe, 1874-12-18**, which gives both
2 CONT parents — [[hendrik_vdb]] and [[coekelberghs]] — and so places this person in the tree by the act
2 CONT rather than by a name. The father is aged 25, born at **Everberg**; the mother is aged 26, born at
2 CONT **Bertem** — both matching this couple's own recorded birthplaces exactly.
2 CONT
2 CONT The act is held in the harvested corpus and reached through Open Archives:
2 CONT https://www.openarchieven.nl/abl:be7d371f-9949-fa85-0483-d43f287c93f3
2 CONT
2 CONT A rival same-name candidate was checked and ruled out: a different Victor Vandenbemden, son of
2 CONT Andre Vandenbemden x Catherine Pauline Cammaerts, marries at Tervuren in 1894 and again in 1919 —
2 CONT a different family, not this child grown up.
2 CONT
2 CONT `sup`: an indexed act, not the register image. **No `sex` is recorded**, because the harvested
2 CONT mention carries only the relation role and never a sex, and this project does not read a sex off a
2 CONT forename.
