1 NOTE Spouse (no record of their own): (wife unrecorded)
1 NOTE Father of Joanna (Janneken) van Hecke (~1610–1678), who married Segerius Bundervoet —
2 CONT so a direct ancestor, and with a birth about 1580 one of the earliest people in the
2 CONT tree.
2 CONT
2 CONT The paulderidder chart gives him as her father, born about 1580, with the mother shown
2 CONT only as "?". Joanna's record previously said her parents were "not recorded here";
2 CONT they were.
2 CONT
2 CONT WORTH NOTING, NOT YET CLAIMED: Livinus Bundervoet's second wife was a Catharina van
2 CONT Hecke (~1620–~1670), while his son Segerius married this Joanna van Hecke (~1610).
2 CONT Two van Hecke women marrying father and son suggests one van Hecke family, and
2 CONT possibly sisters — but nothing seen so far states a relationship between them, so
2 CONT none is recorded here.
